[agent] ## Result
[agent] **Feature group `recsfd473b`, version 1** now exists on the platform with:
[agent] - **200 rows** = 40 users × 5 recommendations each
[agent] - Columns exactly: `rec_id`, `user_id`, `rank`, `item_id`
